(132, 2, 13, 39, 'Good day. We have not received your location updates for over 15 minutes. Please ensure that your Location Services and internet connection (WiFi/mobile data) are turned on so the system can continuously verify your presence inside the event venue.\n\nThis is very important for your attendance record. Failure to restore tracking may affect your attendance status.', 1, '2026-09-14 18:08:45'),
