(413, 6, 15, 2095, 'Good day. Our records show that you have been outside the event venue for more than 30 minutes. The Supreme Student Council is aware of this. Please report back to the SSC Office or directly to the SSC President before logging out to void the warning. Otherwise, you will be marked absent and may incur penalties.\n\nThank You!', 1, '2026-09-14 22:06:08'),
